flowchart LR
  G[Git + immutable image digest] --> CI[CI manifest and policy checks]
  CI --> API[Kubernetes API server]
  API --> D[Deployment controller]
  D --> RS[ReplicaSet]
  RS --> S[Scheduler]
  S --> N[Worker node with allocatable CPU / memory]
  N --> K[Kubelet + container runtime]
  K --> P[Pod: model API]
  P --> SP[Startup probe]
  SP --> RP[Readiness probe]
  RP --> SV[Service endpoints]
  SV --> I[Ingress / gateway]
  P --> LP[Liveness probe]
  M[Metrics pipeline] --> H[HPA]
  H --> D
  GPU[GPU device plugin] --> S
  NP[NetworkPolicy + CNI] -. restricts .-> P
  style P fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
  style SP fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
